="button" class="v5-completion-btn v5-completion-btn--primary v5-btn v5-btn--primary v5-btn--commit" data-testid="payment-surface-new-sale">بيع جديد</button></div></div></section></div><output class="v5-fit-guard__live" data-testid="fit-block-live"></output></div>",
